  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Authentication Flow",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 Request OTP",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const response = pm.response.json();",
                  "    console.log('✓ OTP requested successfully');",
                  "    console.log('Check your phone or Firebase console for OTP');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phoneNumber}}\",\n  \"role\": \"customer\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/request-otp",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "request-otp"]
            },
            "description": "Request OTP for phone number authentication. OTP will be sent via Firebase Auth SMS to your phone."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 Verify OTP & Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const response = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', response.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', response.refreshToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('customerUid', response.user.uid);",
                  "    console.log('✓ Login successful');",
                  "    console.log('Access Token:', response.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log('Customer UID:', response.user.uid);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phoneNumber}}\",\n  \"otpCode\": \"{{otp}}\",\n  \"role\": \"customer\",\n  \"name\": \"John Doe\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "verify-otp"]
            },
            "description": "Verify OTP and complete login. Check your phone for the 6-digit OTP code sent via SMS.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `phone` (required): Phone number with country code\n- `otpCode` (required): 6-digit OTP received via SMS\n- `role` (optional): User role (defaults to 'customer')\n- `name` (optional): User's full name (optional for first-time registration)\n\n**Response includes:**\n- `accessToken`: JWT access token (15 minutes expiry)\n- `refreshToken`: JWT refresh token (7 days expiry)\n- `user`: User object with complete profile\n  - `uid`: Unique user identifier\n  - `roles`: Array of user roles\n  - `primaryRole`: Primary user role\n  - `status`: Account status (active/pending/blocked/suspended)\n  - `name`: User's full name\n  - `email`: User's email (if available)\n  - `phone`: User's phone number\n  - `mobile`: User's mobile number\n  - `verification`: Verification status object\n    - `isVerified`: Overall verification status\n    - `emailVerified`: Email verification status\n    - `phoneVerified`: Phone verification status\n    - `kycStatus`: KYC status (pending/approved/rejected)\n  - `permissions`: User permissions object\n  - `profileData`: Additional profile data (timezone, language, etc.)\n\n**Auto-creates:**\n- User record in `users` collection\n- Customer profile in `customers` collection (for customer role)\n\nSaves access token automatically to collection variables."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const response = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', response.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log('✓ Token refreshed');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Refresh expired access token using refresh token"
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Complete authentication flow: Request OTP → Verify OTP → Get Access Token"
    },
